Package: filterRead
Type: Package
Title: Pre-filters files using awk for faster fread
Version: 2.17.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Sulc",
                  email = "jonsulc@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates an easy-to-use interface for loading tab/comma-separated
    value files efficiently. Conditions for filtering can be specified in
    R-style and are translated to awk command line before passing on to
    data.table::fread for loading.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0),
    data.table (>= 1.16.0)
Imports:
